<p>I was thinking of something closer to a reality-anchor with memory altering effects, though thanks for pointing out the similarities that it has with 1915.</p>
<p>I would say that since the person moves around the city and the zone remains the same size it would be impractical for the Foundation to essentially neutralized SCPs for a couple of hours since they have no way of getting anything beyond the borders. I intend to have it so the memories and effects return after some time outside the zone related to the amount of time spent inside, but I was considering making it so any anomaly passed a certain level couldn't enter.</p>
<p>The focus on what supernatural phenomenon he is interested in as it relates to his abilities is something worth developing so I'll keep it in mind for the second half.</p>

