<p>Hello folks, I am TruckRail82. I have been a lurker on the wiki for about 1 and a half years now, just reading articles and tales. I actually did join last month, but was kept busy by real life obligations. I figured it might be worthwhile to actually contribute to here, and to develop my English writing skills as a result. I do not have any ideas for SCPs as such, but who knows, I might be inspired one random day.</p>
<p>As for how I got into the wiki, well, one of my IRL friends introduced me to SCP:CB back when we were in uni and had a carp ton(typo intentional) of free time, and I found this site had a lot more of where those came from.<br />
To answer the QotM, I am actually a good sleeper, so if there is something that does keep me awake, its probably some kind of feverish delusions.<br />
Cheers, and I hope I can meet some cool people!</p>

